l, and two-factor authentication (2FA) settings simultaneously is a red flag. It looks like a hack. Instead, use a clean browser profile. Avoid using a VPN during the first week. Let the account \\\"settle\\\" on your local Indian IP address. Only update recovery information after you\'ve successfully become the Primary Owner. This \\\"cooling off\\\" period prevents automated account suspensions. To begin this process with a verified channel, you can [secure your next digital asset](https://accsmarkets.org) through our protected marketplace.\\n\\nThe AdSense transition requires equal care. You cannot buy a seller\'s personal AdSense account. You must link your own Indian AdSense profile. Wait at least 48 hours after the ownership transfer is complete before updating the payment settings. This ensures the algorithm recognizes you as the legitimate owner. Proper synchronization between your YouTube Studio and AdSense is the final step in securing your revenue stream. Follow the steps. Protect the asset. Start earning.\\n\\n## <a name=\\\"accsmarkets-the-safest-place-to-buy-youtube-channels\\\"></a>AccsMarkets: The Safest Place to Buy YouTube Channels\\n\\nAccsMarkets isn\'t just a marketplace. It\'s a security-first ecosystem built for the high-stakes transfer of digital property. When you decide to **buy youtube channel for monetization**, you need more than a simple listing; you need a guarantee of integrity. We provide an extensive platform where every channel\'s monetization status is verified before it ever appears in our search results. Our vigilant escrow system holds your capital in a secure state until the handover is complete. We eliminate the risk of seller disappearance through automated protocols. Your credentials move through an encrypted handover process that ensures maximum privacy for both parties. Trust is earned through verification, not promises.\\n\\n### Why India\'s Creators Choose AccsMarkets\\n\\nIndia\'s digital economy moves faster than lega