ast 48 hours after becoming the Primary Owner before updating these payment settings. This cooling-off period helps the system recognize your new authority without flagging the account for suspicious activity.\\n\\n### What happens if the seller tries to take the channel back?\\n\\nOur secure escrow system is designed to prevent account reclamation. We require a full ownership handover before any funds are released to the seller. Once you complete the 7-day transfer process and remove the seller as an owner, they lose all technical access to the asset. By following our linear protocol, you eliminate the possibility of the seller using recovery tools to regain control.\\n\\n### How long does the full ownership transfer take?\\n\\nThe full transfer takes exactly 7 days to complete. This is a mandatory Google security period that starts once you\'re added as a Manager to the Brand Account. You cannot bypass this waiting period. It\'s a built-in protection measure that ensures the transfer is authorized and legitimate. We hold your funds in escrow throughout this entire duration to protect your capital.\\n\\n### Can I change the niche of a channel after I buy it?\\n\\nYou can change the niche, but doing so often causes a temporary drop in engagement. The YouTube algorithm has already indexed the channel for a specific audience. If you pivot too drastically, your new videos won\'t reach the existing subscribers\' feeds effectively. To maintain revenue, it\'s better to choose a channel that already aligns with your intended content strategy.\\n\\n### What payment methods are supported on AccsMarkets?\\n\\nAccsMarkets utilizes a crypto-based escrow system for all transactions. We support USDT, BTC, and ETH to provide speed and security that traditional banking methods can\'t match. This eliminates the risk of payment reversals and ensures the seller receives their funds only after you\'ve secured the channel. Crypto payments allow for fast, borderless transactions without 