ce than a generic meme or entertainment channel. You should review active marketplace listings to understand current valuations based on specific performance metrics and audience demographics.</p>\n\n<h3>What is an OGE and why is it critical for channel security?</h3>\n<p>OGE stands for Original Email, which is the first email address ever used to register the account. Google\'s automated support systems prioritize this address during ownership disputes. If a seller retains the OGE, they can potentially convince support that they were hacked and reclaim the channel. Securing the OGE is the most vital step for long-term account integrity.</p>\n\n<h3>How do I transfer the AdSense account to my own name?</h3>\n<p>You don\'t actually transfer the seller\'s AdSense account; you link your own. Navigate to the \"Earn\" tab in YouTube Studio and select the option to change the linked AdSense account. You\'ll then link your verified Indian AdSense profile to ensure all future earnings are deposited directly into your local bank account without any ties to the previous owner.</p>\n\n<h3>Can I still get the Silver Play Button after buying a channel?</h3>\n<p>Yes, you can still apply for the Silver Creator Award if the channel meets YouTube\'s eligibility criteria. The channel must be in \"Good Standing\" with zero active strikes and a history of original content. If you buy youtube channel with 100k subscribers that has a history of copyright issues, YouTube\'s manual review team may deny the application for the award trophy.</p>\n\n<h3>What happens if the seller doesn\'t provide the correct credentials?</h3>\n<p>Our escrow system acts as a neutral barrier to protect your capital. Funds aren\'t released to the seller until you confirm that you\'ve received the correct credentials and verified the channel\'s technical health. If the seller fails to deliver or provides fraudulent data, the dispute resolution team intervenes to return your funds. This ensures you never pay for an