ity\" tab in the Google Account settings for third-party app permissions. Rogue apps can maintain persistent access even after a password change. Revoke everything. A clean break is the only way to ensure your investment is permanent and secure.\n\n## <a name=\"accsmarkets-the-vigilant-marketplace-for-youtube-assets\"></a>AccsMarkets: The Vigilant Marketplace for YouTube Assets\n\nAccsMarkets isn\'t just a storefront. It\'s a digital fortress designed for high-stakes trades. In the **youtube channel buy and sell** market, the biggest threat is the unknown. You don\'t know the person on the other side of the screen. We solve this by providing a structured peer-to-peer ecosystem. Our platform bridges the trust gap by acting as a neutral, firm intermediary. We ensure that fairness and accountability aren\'t optional. They\'re built into every transaction.\n\nTraditional banking and PayPal are built for physical goods, not digital assets. They\'re vulnerable to chargebacks and payment reversals that can happen months after a deal. We eliminate this risk. Our escrow system utilizes crypto-based payments like USDT, BTC, and ETH. These transactions are non-reversible. Once the verification period ends and funds are released, the deal is final. This protects sellers from fraudulent \"item not received\" claims while ensuring buyers\' capital is held safely until they have full control.\n\nOur expertise extends beyond a single platform. We facilitate secure handovers for YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook Pages, X (Twitter), and Telegram channels. Every high-value trade is monitored. We provide professional moderation to navigate the complexities of account handovers. If a dispute arises, a seasoned expert steps in to review the evidence. We prioritize transactional integrity over marketing fluff. You get a controlled environment, not a chaotic forum.\n\n### Transaction Security Features\n\nSecurity is baked into our architecture. We use encrypted data exchange for every c