rs?\\n\\nCrypto payments like USDT and BTC provide non-reversible security that traditional banking cannot offer. Bank transfers and PayPal are vulnerable to chargebacks and \\\"friendly fraud\\\" that can occur months after a deal is finalized. Crypto ensures that once escrow conditions are met, the payment is final. It also allows for instant, global settlements without the high fees or multi-day delays associated with international wire transfers and currency conversions.\\n\\n### Can I buy a YouTube channel with a pre-existing AdSense account?\\n\\nIt is generally not recommended to acquire the seller\'s personal AdSense account. AdSense profiles are tied to individual tax identities, making them difficult and risky to transfer. The professional approach is to acquire the channel and then link your own approved AdSense account. Our marketplace provides the necessary guidance to ensure this transition happens smoothly without triggering automated fraud detection filters or violating YouTube’s Content Monetization Policies.\",\"heroImageUrl\":\"https://getautoseo.com/storage/hero_images/youtube-channel-buy-and-sell-the-2026-guide-to-secure-transfers.jpg?v=8821669a9ac2\",\"heroImageAlt\":\"YouTube Channel Buy and Sell: The 2026 Guide to Secure Transfers\",\"infographicImageUrl\":\"https://getautoseo.com/storage/screenshots/generated/2026/08/getautoseocom_1785587324_qchverR3.jpg\",\"keywords\":[\"youtube channel buy and sell\"],\"metaKeywords\":\"youtube channel buy and sell, buy monetized youtube channel, sell youtube channel, youtube channel transfer guide, youtube brand account transfer, youtube channel escrow\",\"wordpressTags\":\"YouTube Channel, Buy YouTube Channel, Sell YouTube Channel, Digital Assets, AdSense, Escrow, Brand Account Transfer, Online Business\",\"faqSchema\":[{\"answer\":\"Sellers are cashing out on digital sweat equity to fund new ventures. In 2026, aged accounts are highly valued. The algorithm trusts them more than fresh registrations. A cr