otects your investment from the risks of a rushed or incomplete credential exchange.</p>\\n\\n<h3>What happens if the account I bought gets banned within 24 hours?</h3>\\n<p>If an account is banned within the first 24 hours due to pre-existing seller violations, our mediation team investigates the audit logs. Our milestone-based protection ensures that funds are not released until the cooling period ends and you confirm the asset\'s health. If the ban results from a seller\'s undisclosed strikes or botting history, the transaction can be reversed through our secure platform. This is why on-platform communication is essential for protection.</p>\\n\\n<h3>Can I buy a TikTok account if I already have a personal one?</h3>\\n<p>You can certainly buy a TikTok account even if you already have a personal one. The TikTok app supports multiple logins on a single device, allowing you to switch between profiles easily. Professional operators often manage several <strong>monetized tiktok accounts for sale</strong> to diversify their reach across different niches. Just ensure each account uses unique login credentials and a clean engagement history to avoid cross-contamination of algorithmic favor.</p>\",\"content_markdown\":\"Building a TikTok presence from zero isn\'t a creative milestone. It\'s a 90-day business liability. Most creators spend months chasing the 10,000-follower threshold only to find their niche has moved on or their momentum has stalled. If you\'re searching for **monetized tiktok accounts for sale**, you aren\'t just buying numbers. You\'re buying immediate market access and a seat in the Creator Rewards Program.\\n\\nWe know the risks that keep you up. You\'ve heard of accounts being recovered by original owners or shadowbanned days after the transfer. These fears are justified when marketplaces prioritize speed over security. You deserve a transition protected by a staged workflow, not a risky handshake deal. This is about professional asset acquisition, no