ral system.</p>\\n\\n<h3>Can TikTok ban my account if I sell it?</h3>\\n<p>Yes, TikTok can ban an account if it detects a suspicious change in ownership. The 2026 Account Health Rating system is vigilant about sudden IP shifts and credential swaps. To prevent a ban, follow a gradual \\\"warm-up\\\" handover. Don\'t change all security settings at once. A methodical transition mimics natural user behavior and keeps the account under the radar.</p>\\n\\n<h3>Why should I use crypto for my account sale instead of PayPal?</h3>\\n<p>Crypto transactions are final; PayPal payments are not. Scammers often use fiat currency to file \\\"unauthorized transaction\\\" claims weeks after the sale. They keep the account and claw back the money. Crypto-native payments like USDT or BTC eliminate this threat. Once the transaction is confirmed on the blockchain, the funds are yours. There is no mechanism for a chargeback.</p>\\n\\n<h3>How long does the account transfer process take on AccsMarkets?</h3>\\n<p>The transfer process usually takes 24 to 48 hours. This duration is intentional. A rapid handover triggers security flags and risks a permanent ban. We prioritize account integrity over immediate speed. The timeline allows the buyer to log in and \\\"warm up\\\" the device ID before changing sensitive security settings. This methodical pace ensures the asset remains healthy and valuable.</p>\\n\\n<h3>What happens if a buyer tries to claim they didn\'t receive the account?</h3>\\n<p>Our moderated messaging system creates a permanent audit trail for every deal. If a buyer claims they didn\'t receive the account, we review the encrypted handover logs and technical evidence. We act as a neutral intermediary to verify the facts. If you provided the correct credentials and OGE as agreed, the funds are released to you. Evidence, not anecdotes, decides the outcome.</p>\",\"content_markdown\":\"A TikTok account with over one million followers is no longer just a social profile; it is a high-