al <b>facebook page marketplace</b> using verified infrastructure that coordinates milestone-based payments.</li>\\n<li>Transition from high-risk peer-to-peer deals to a monitored environment with integrated KYC and KYB accountability.</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"table-of-contents\\\" role=\\\"navigation\\\" aria-label=\\\"Table of Contents\\\">\\n<h2 id=\\\"table-of-contents\\\">Table of Contents</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#defining-the-facebook-page-marketplace-in-2026\\\">Defining the Facebook Page Marketplace in 2026</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#critical-metrics-for-evaluating-marketplace-listings\\\">Critical Metrics for Evaluating Marketplace Listings</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#mitigating-risks-with-staged-transaction-workflows\\\">Mitigating Risks with Staged Transaction Workflows</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#the-step-by-step-facebook-page-acquisition-workflow\\\">The Step-by-Step Facebook Page Acquisition Workflow</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"#accsmarkets-the-infrastructure-layer-for-digital-assets\\\">AccsMarkets: The Infrastructure Layer for Digital Assets</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</div><h2 id=\\\"defining-the-facebook-page-marketplace-in-2026\\\">Defining the Facebook Page Marketplace in 2026</h2>\\n\\n<p>The term \\\"marketplace\\\" on Facebook usually refers to local listings for furniture or electronics. In 2026, a parallel economy exists for digital assets. This professional <b>facebook page marketplace</b> operates outside the standard consumer interface. It focuses on the transfer of audience reach, engagement history, and monetization eligibility. Businesses don\'t want to wait years for organic growth. They want assets that generate revenue today.</p>\\n\\n<h3>Consumer Marketplace vs. Professional Page Acquisition</h3>\\n\\n<p>A standard <a href=\\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Online_marketplace\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">online marketplace</a> handles physical logistics. Digital property rights are differe