ts in 2026 often show massive follower numbers but have negligible video views or repetitive, AI-generated comments. Real accounts show varied engagement patterns and a steady growth history that matches the content\'s viral peaks.</p>\\n\\n<h3>Do I need the original email (OGE) to be safe?</h3>\\n<p>Securing the original email is the most critical factor when deciding <strong>is buying a tiktok account safe</strong> for your business. The OGE is the master key that TikTok uses for all identity recovery requests. If you don\'t control the OGE, the seller can reclaim the account at any time. A secure transaction must include the full transfer of the email account used to create the profile.</p>\\n\\n<h3>How long does the account transfer process usually take?</h3>\\n<p>A secure transfer takes between 48 and 72 hours. This isn\'t just for changing passwords. It includes a mandatory monitoring phase to ensure the account doesn\'t trigger security locks. Rushing the process is a common mistake that leads to immediate bans. Professional infrastructure enforces this timeline to protect the buyer\'s investment and ensure the account remains stable under new ownership.</p>\\n\\n<h3>What is the safest payment method for social media accounts?</h3>\\n<p>Milestone-based payments through a verified marketplace are the only secure option. Never use \\\"Friends and Family\\\" fiat transfers or direct bank wires. These methods offer zero recourse once the funds are sent. A professional marketplace holds the capital and only releases it after you verify account access and clear the security period. This structure eliminates the risk of the seller vanishing after payment.</p>\\n\\n<h3>Should I change the content niche after buying an account?</h3>\\n<p>Do not change the niche immediately after purchase. TikTok\'s algorithm identifies sudden content shifts as a sign of a compromised account, which often results in a shadowban. Maintain the original content style for at least two week