 password\\\" swap. It involves a systematic update of recovery phone numbers, secondary emails, and two-factor authentication (2FA) codes. Finalize the transfer only after the buyer confirms they have full administrative control. A rushed handover is a failed handover.\\n\\n### Safe Credential Transfer Protocol\\n\\nTechnical precision prevents platform bans. On YouTube and Facebook, changing the Primary Owner is a multi-day process. You must add the buyer as a manager first, then wait for the platform\'s mandatory cooling-off period before promoting them to Primary Owner. This slow transition avoids triggering \\\"unusual activity\\\" flags. You must also address the Original Email (OGE). Buyers in 2026 prioritize accounts that include the OGE because it is the only way to guarantee the account cannot be \\\"pulled back\\\" by the original creator. If you cannot provide the OGE, expect a lower valuation.\\n\\nTiming is everything. Sudden location shifts trigger automated security lockdowns. Advise the buyer to use a clean proxy or a high-quality VPN that matches your general region during the initial login. This mimics natural user behavior and reduces the risk of an immediate IP flag. Small technical details like these separate professional sellers from amateurs.\\n\\n### Managing Post-Sale Disputes\\n\\nDisputes are rare in a structured environment, but you must be prepared. We use a documented timeline of the entire transaction to resolve conflicts. If a buyer claims an issue, our administrators review the audit logs and ownership evidence you provided during the listing phase. This objective review ensures fairness for both parties. Our internal security benchmarks ensure that every documented transaction meets the highest industry standards for protection. Ready to begin? [Start your secure transaction now](https://accsmarkets.org) to ensure your digital asset exit is handled with professional integrity.\\n\\n## <a name=\\\"scaling-your-social-asset-portfolio