ess and providing a 24-hour inspection period. Our platform monitors seller behavior and uses a trust-score system to penalize those who attempt ownership reversals after a deal closes.</p>\n\n<h3>Does AccsMarkets verify the identity of sellers?</h3>\n<p>Yes, we implement integrated KYC and KYB verification for professional sellers and high-value transactions. This process requires sellers to provide government-issued identification or business documentation. By removing anonymity, we ensure that every participant is accountable for their actions. Accountability is the cornerstone of our marketplace security and helps maintain a high-quality inventory for buyers.</p>\n\n<h3>Can I buy a YouTube channel that is already monetized?</h3>\n<p>You can purchase established YouTube channels that already meet monetization requirements through our marketplace. These assets are highly valued because they offer immediate revenue potential for digital entrepreneurs. We recommend verifying the monetization status and clean history during the mandatory inspection window. Using our advanced filters, you can specifically isolate niche-relevant, monetized properties for your portfolio growth.</p>\n\n<h3>What payment methods are supported on the platform?</h3>\n<p>Supported payment methods currently include Perfect Money, Advcash, WebMoney, and Litecoin. Refunds are specifically limited to these systems if an invalid account cannot be replaced by the seller. We utilize these providers to ensure transaction speed and security in the digital asset space. Always check the current list of approved payment gateways before initiating a high-value transfer.</p>\n\n<h3>What happens if the seller does not deliver the credentials?</h3>\n<p>If a seller fails to deliver credentials, your funds remain secured in the milestone bridge. You simply trigger the moderated dispute resolution process within the platform. Our admins review the audit logs and secure messaging history to verify the delivery f