he channel meets YouTube\'s eligibility criteria. The channel must be in \"Good Standing\" with zero active strikes and a history of original content. If you buy youtube channel with 100k subscribers that has a history of copyright issues, YouTube\'s manual review team may deny the application for the award trophy.</p>\n\n<h3>What happens if the seller doesn\'t provide the correct credentials?</h3>\n<p>Our escrow system acts as a neutral barrier to protect your capital. Funds aren\'t released to the seller until you confirm that you\'ve received the correct credentials and verified the channel\'s technical health. If the seller fails to deliver or provides fraudulent data, the dispute resolution team intervenes to return your funds. This ensures you never pay for an asset you don\'t fully control.</p>','/api/blog-images/autoseo-3330074-hero.jpg','PUBLISHED',NULL,'buy youtube channel with 100k subscribers',170,1,'2026-07-29 12:00:00.000','2026-07-27 22:33:31.727','2026-09-16 14:52:48.367'),('cms3szrex00025i1xcppkkqah','buy-youtube-channel-safe-acquisition-guide-2026','Buy YouTube Channel: Safe Acquisition Guide 2026','Want to buy a YouTube channel for monetization? Our 2026 guide shows you how to safely skip the 4,000-hour grind and start earning with secure escrow.','<p>Building a YouTube channel from zero isn\'t a strategy; it\'s a massive drain on your most valuable resource. You shouldn\'t have to wait months or years to see your first Rupee in ad revenue. Smart creators choose to buy youtube channel for monetization to skip the 4,000-hour grind and start earning immediately. It\'s about moving fast while staying protected. This is about professional acquisition, not amateur guesswork. Speed is an asset. Safety is a requirement.</p>\n\n<p>You\'re likely worried about the risks of account reclamation or getting shadowbanned after a transfer. We understand that security is your primary concern. Buying an account should feel like a strategic investment, not a gamble