rs like PayPal don\'t protect sellers of digital assets. The service ensures the money exists and is verified before you hand over control. This eliminates the risk of chargebacks. It provides a secure environment where both parties are held accountable through KYC checks and detailed audit logs.</p>\n\n<h3>How long does the safe transfer process actually take?</h3>\n<p>The transfer process takes exactly seven days to complete. This timeline is fixed by Google’s security protocols. You can invite a buyer as an owner immediately, but they cannot become the Primary Owner until the 168-hour window closes. Use this time to ensure your payment is fully secured in escrow. Don\'t attempt to rush this period. It is a built-in safety mechanism that protects you from impulsive or fraudulent takeover attempts.</p>','/api/blog-images/autoseo-3330078-hero.jpg','PUBLISHED',NULL,'how to sell a youtube channel safely',175,1,'2026-08-04 10:00:00.000','2026-08-04 10:31:54.788','2026-09-16 14:52:48.172'),('cmsfxjoz3000amog61y37tewn','buy-instagram-account-with-followers-the-2026-secure-acquisition-guide','Buy Instagram Account with Followers: The 2026 Secure Acquisition Guide','Want to buy an Instagram account with followers? Our 2026 guide shows how to avoid scams, verify real users, and secure your investment for instant authority.','<p>The fastest way to gain social authority is to buy instagram account with followers, but most buyers lose their investment before the first post. You want a monetization-ready audience, not a scam. You likely fear the original owner reclaiming the account or discovering those 50,000 followers are just low-quality bots that Meta\'s June 2026 spam update will purge. These aren\'t just anxieties. They are expensive realities in an unregulated market.</p>\n<p>We prioritize security over marketing fluff. This guide teaches you to safely acquire established Instagram assets while avoiding the pitfalls of ghost sellers and recovery scams. You\'ll learn how 