l with a content history dating back to 2020. The channel includes videos across lo-fi music, entertainment, movie-related content, and 4K travel footage, with one uploaded video reaching over 4,000 views.\n\nThe channel is currently not monetized, and most existing videos are unlisted or private, giving the new owner flexibility to rebrand it and launch a fresh content strategy. It may suit a buyer interested in music, entertainment, travel, compilations, or faceless YouTube content.\n\nThe branded channel name, logo, existing uploads, and channel history are included. Selling because I am focusing on other projects. Transfer will be completed using YouTube’s proper ownership and permissions process.\n\nImportant: Only add claims such as “no strikes,” “copyright clean,” or “eligible for monetization” after confirming them inside YouTube Studio.',50.00,15400,75,580,1,25000000,3.90,1.50,'English','2019-04-14 00:00:00.000',0,0,NULL,'CHANGEABLE','Beat Fusion','[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1noj2rI7vnSf2VyuNHbOg2l8ydDP4YTq2\", \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1XU3yflUvOp6YetJAgt5yPVajZ-1sSsV4\", \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/10DP0EXgb72T_sKuoet7P_2hh6DDmuY7Z\", \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1mT8rV2y9LT9C-P5mUpreuBFZ4XIZzQti\"]','AM-379E6C11',1,'YOUTUBE_API','2026-07-25 18:40:42.199','UCqyJi8JzUY2aop0fvwgrdhg','ACTIVE',0,NULL,261,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:40:42.212','2026-09-16 22:35:45.872','2026-07-25 18:40:49.833',NULL,'FIXED',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://yt3.ggpht.com/I1BsmnGw3nNTPzYj3Vprv2AbggJcFNWPGflD98MIml2nXPT75uZldHY8WY6i_Hgp3IraK3EwhQ=s240-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj','Music'),('cms3a0ao6000lvhos33opz53l','cmrz6qkfk000mvs869uavrwi6','FACEBOOK','https://www.facebook.com/Quranparaables/','Fully Monetized Quran & Islamic Facebook Page with Content Monetization','Quranparaables ek fully monetized Islamic Facebook page hai jisme Content Monetization active hai. Page par Quranic verses, Islamic reminders, motivational posts a